      "normalizedSource": "If you specify [`true`](https://developer.apple.com/documentation/Swift/true) for the [`checkConsistency`](scnscenesource/loadingoption/checkconsistency.md) option when creating or loading from a scene source, SceneKit verifies the scene file against the specification for its file format.",
      "sourceHash": "a0700ae87ceab931eed12b8cb2cdf34bdaddbb0384025b2470d77c0afbcef040",
