      "contextBefore": "If SceneKit reports an error when creating or loading from a scene source, the [`userInfo`](https://developer.apple.com/documentation/Foundation/NSError/userInfo) dictionary of the returned [`NSError`](https://developer.apple.com/documentation/Foundation/NSError) object may contain this key, whose value is an array of dictionaries (each containing one or more of the keys listed in [`Scene File Consistency Error Keys`](scene-file-consistency-error-keys.md)) providing details about the location of the error in the scene file.",
